{"id":"614320","name":"芝士焗虾","author":"°ZWH","authorId":"11170916","desc":"","cover":"images/614320/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"适量"},{"name":"芝士","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"虾洗净，厨房纸巾吸走多余水分，开背，去虾线。","img":"images/614320/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"用刀背轻拍虾肉，拍段筋烤出来才能不扭曲。","img":"images/614320/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"土豆碾碎成土豆泥。","img":"images/614320/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加一丢丢盐。","img":"images/614320/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"磨进去一丢丢黑胡椒粉。","img":"images/614320/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"混合均匀。","img":"images/614320/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"土豆泥团成长条，均匀铺在虾上。烤箱200度预热五分钟。","img":"images/614320/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"洒芝士。","img":"images/614320/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"度烤10分钟左右，先放中层烤，具体时间根据上色情况决定。","img":"images/614320/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"芝士融化后可以改放上层烤。","img":"images/614320/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"上色效果还不错，赶紧出炉。","img":"images/614320/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/614320/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}